Ritual Timing
Sprint Duration	Team members perform work every day to move sprint forward towards achieving the sprint goal.

Daily Stand-up	Designated time every day.

Spring Planning	Beginning of every sprint.

Spring Review	A scheduled meeting where the completed increment is demonstrated to stakeholders and feedback about increment viability is received by the team.

Sprint Retrospective	The final meeting of a sprint where team members evaluate how well they performed as a team in this sprint. The goal of this meeting is to look for ways that the team can improve their productivity and increase their velocity.
























